X: 1
T: Sonatine
O: Joe Hisaishi, 1993
N: Theme from Takeshi Kitano's film. From a user-uploaded midishow.com MIDI, moved -7 semitones: the pulse figure from channel 1, then the melody from channels 0 and 14. In the original the pulse runs under the whole piece; here it is a 4-bar intro. The closing return of the theme is left to the loop. CHECK: unverified hobby arrangement; chords are fitted, with D changed to Dm because the MIDI has no third.
L: 1/8
Q: 1/4=100
M: 4/4
K: Dm
